{"logId": "0ce4b1af-c98e-4cf9-97b6-5745d3a2bf03", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [838, 134, 1083, 253], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[838.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [838.0, 253.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "电器在新乡的这3年", "block_bbox": [198, 227, 647, 283], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 227.0], [647.0, 227.0], [647.0, 283.0], [198.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：新乡百货电器部", "block_bbox": [475, 293, 641, 315], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[475.0, 292.9999694824219], [640.0, 292.9999694824219], [640.0, 313.9999694824219], [475.0, 313.9999694824219]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "胖东来进入新乡三年了，这三年里有泪水，有感动，更多的是收获。伴随着激情、坦诚和奋斗，我们共同经历了难忘的三年风雨洗礼，同时也享受了工作带来的快乐和人生信念。", "block_bbox": [197, 372, 975, 468], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 372.0], [975.0, 372.0], [975.0, 468.0], [197.0, 468.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "记得刚开业的时候，当时电器卖场在四楼，促销只有十几个人，由于地理位置很多人都不太看好，经过大家共同的努力，公司的超值服务、亲情服务、“不满意就退货”……每当看到我们卖场人山人海的时候我们都会情不自禁的感动，有今天的成绩是和我们的团队分不开的。", "block_bbox": [198, 476, 976, 607], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 476.0], [976.0, 476.0], [976.0, 607.0], [198.0, 607.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "公平、民主、能上能下", "block_bbox": [239, 616, 493, 645], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 616.0], [493.0, 616.0], [493.0, 645.0], [239.0, 645.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不想当将军的士兵，不是好士兵", "block_bbox": [249, 650, 546, 676], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[249.0, 650.0], [546.0, 650.0], [546.0, 676.0], [249.0, 676.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "在任何单位，任何部门，这种观念都很强烈。我们的团队也不例外，任何事物都有自己独特的见解，为着同一个信仰，为着公司经营理念的吸引，为着人生中能遇到一个千载难逢的好老板，大家走到了一起，抱成团，开始自己新的生活，新的奋斗。为给每个人提供更广阔的纵横空间，以实现个人职业生涯的辉煌，我们采用“公平、民主、能上能下”的观念，让大家在竞争中重新认识自己，提升自己，丰富自己。", "block_bbox": [196, 687, 619, 1026], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[196.0, 687.0], [619.0, 687.0], [619.0, 1026.0], [196.0, 1026.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "给自己和员工定位", "block_bbox": [238, 1035, 445, 1064], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1035.0], [445.0, 1035.0], [445.0, 1064.0], [238.0, 1064.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作为主管，首先要管理好自己，自己在各方面一定要做到最好，自己的一举一动能影响到每一位团队中的成员，要有海阔天空的胸襟，用真诚去打动每位员工。再者要让他们明白自己在团队中要扮演的角色，将要承担的责任，以及可以从中得到的历练。更要让他们明白，只有团队的", "block_bbox": [198, 1070, 688, 1178], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 1070.0], [688.0, 1070.0], [688.0, 1178.0], [198.0, 1178.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [197, 1172, 974, 1236], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 1172.0], [974.0, 1172.0], [974.0, 1236.0], [197.0, 1236.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [614, 610, 982, 1133], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[614.0, 610.0], [982.0, 610.0], [982.0, 1133.0], [614.0, 1133.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1008, 608, 1137, 725], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[1008.0, 608.0], [1137.0, 608.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1008.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7441705465316772, "coordinate": [838, 134, 1083, 253], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[838.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [838.0, 253.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.9044913053512573, "coordinate": [198, 227, 647, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 227.0], [647.0, 227.0], [647.0, 283.0], [198.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7830097079277039, "coordinate": [475, 293, 641, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[475.0, 292.9999694824219], [640.0, 292.9999694824219], [640.0, 313.9999694824219], [475.0, 313.9999694824219]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9324620962142944, "coordinate": [197, 372, 975, 468], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 372.0], [975.0, 372.0], [975.0, 468.0], [197.0, 468.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9469567537307739, "coordinate": [198, 476, 976, 607], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 476.0], [976.0, 476.0], [976.0, 607.0], [198.0, 607.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8465951085090637, "coordinate": [239, 616, 493, 645], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 616.0], [493.0, 616.0], [493.0, 645.0], [239.0, 645.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7146258354187012, "coordinate": [249, 650, 546, 676], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[249.0, 650.0], [546.0, 650.0], [546.0, 676.0], [249.0, 676.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9425838589668274, "coordinate": [196, 687, 619, 1026], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[196.0, 687.0], [619.0, 687.0], [619.0, 1026.0], [196.0, 1026.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8469001054763794, "coordinate": [238, 1035, 445, 1064], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 1035.0], [445.0, 1035.0], [445.0, 1064.0], [238.0, 1064.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6384506821632385, "coordinate": [198, 1070, 688, 1178], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 1070.0], [688.0, 1070.0], [688.0, 1178.0], [198.0, 1178.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9200788140296936, "coordinate": [614, 610, 982, 1133], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[614.0, 610.0], [982.0, 610.0], [982.0, 1133.0], [614.0, 1133.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.7183476686477661, "coordinate": [743, 1169, 956, 1192], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[743.0, 1169.0], [956.0, 1169.0], [956.0, 1192.0], [743.0, 1192.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4766710102558136, "coordinate": [197, 1172, 974, 1236], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 1172.0], [974.0, 1172.0], [974.0, 1236.0], [197.0, 1236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.33389517664909363, "coordinate": [199, 1208, 973, 1236], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 1208.0], [973.0, 1208.0], [973.0, 1236.0], [199.0, 1236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6742678284645081, "coordinate": [1008, 608, 1137, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1008.0, 608.0], [1137.0, 608.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1008.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 电器在新乡的这3年\n\n作者：新乡百货电器部\n\n胖东来进入新乡三年了，这三年里有泪水，有感动，更多的是收获。伴随着激情、坦诚和奋斗，我们共同经历了难忘的三年风雨洗礼，同时也享受了工作带来的快乐和人生信念。\n\n记得刚开业的时候，当时电器卖场在四楼，促销只有十几个人，由于地理位置很多人都不太看好，经过大家共同的努力，公司的超值服务、亲情服务、“不满意就退货”……每当看到我们卖场人山人海的时候我们都会情不自禁的感动，有今天的成绩是和我们的团队分不开的。\n\n## 公平、民主、能上能下\n\n不想当将军的士兵，不是好士兵\n\n在任何单位，任何部门，这种观念都很强烈。我们的团队也不例外，任何事物都有自己独特的见解，为着同一个信仰，为着公司经营理念的吸引，为着人生中能遇到一个千载难逢的好老板，大家走到了一起，抱成团，开始自己新的生活，新的奋斗。为给每个人提供更广阔的纵横空间，以实现个人职业生涯的辉煌，我们采用“公平、民主、能上能下”的观念，让大家在竞争中重新认识自己，提升自己，丰富自己。\n\n## 给自己和员工定位\n\n作为主管，首先要管理好自己，自己在各方面一定要做到最好，自己的一举一动能影响到每一位团队中的成员，要有海阔天空的胸襟，用真诚去打动每位员工。再者要让他们明白自己在团队中要扮演的角色，将要承担的责任，以及可以从中得到的历练。更要让他们明白，只有团队的\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_614_610_982_1133.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"30%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1008_608_1137_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"10%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_838_134_1083_253.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0ce4b1af-c98e-4cf9-97b6-5745d3a2bf03/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_838_134_1083_253.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A49%3A54Z%2F-1%2F%2F8451660a33d7e0da4f2cb132a4b58fb77c3c26f0bd076319c938cec831009b49", "imgs/img_in_image_box_614_610_982_1133.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0ce4b1af-c98e-4cf9-97b6-5745d3a2bf03/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_614_610_982_1133.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A49%3A54Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb6eb49aa5553fdaab1ba252f1c24854f9466b9c2ec7aa698e55ba98331536c9e", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1008_608_1137_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0ce4b1af-c98e-4cf9-97b6-5745d3a2bf03/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1008_608_1137_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A49%3A54Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa1664fd8c5a316c90df7f0213f54cf2644221778f17b2ec8324a84b4628559d7"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0ce4b1af-c98e-4cf9-97b6-5745d3a2bf03/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A49%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F003bb670d09ab4c0d5c70e18abb9e1076b86b4f77b20289f0cd261efa3e31d48"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0ce4b1af-c98e-4cf9-97b6-5745d3a2bf03/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A49%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa1b742290949e429d0c93cb81dc31615dac2d29188886dc21d61454873d32af7"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}]